cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the PocketGull Typeface Superfamily in clinical software, medical informatics, or vision science research, please cite it as below."
title: "PocketGull Typeface Superfamily"
abstract: "A clinical and ophthalmological vector typeface superfamily bridging tactile humanist warmth with zero-error clinical precision, featuring 256 Unicode Braille patterns, ISMP/FDA character disambiguation, and Louise Sloan 5:1 optotypic geometry."
